      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "(3)  PRE-TRANSACTION verdict\n     plugin challenge types ONLY\n\nTypeRegistry.Resolve(ch.Type)\n\n  unregistered -> 503 reject-retry\n  built-in     -> skip to (4)\n  plugin       -> early solved check,\n                  then CheckFlag",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r_1436",
      "originalText": "(3)  PRE-TRANSACTION verdict\n     plugin challenge types ONLY\n\nTypeRegistry.Resolve(ch.Type)\n\n  unregistered -> 503 reject-retry\n  built-in     -> skip to (4)\n  plugin       -> early solved check,\n                  then CheckFlag",
