      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "(5)  POST-COMMIT \u2014 correct solves only\n\nCountChallengeSolves\n\nbuilt-in mode -> scoring.Value(formula)\n\nplugin mode -> pluginScorer.Score\n   gRPC, deadline-bounded\n   -> value        (the plugin's)\n   -> 'fallback'   (static, opt-in)\n   -> 'pending'    (plugin down)\n\nRecordScore(scored_value, scored_by)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
